Fonts from the discourse-fonts gem 0.0.19 (vendor/assets/fonts), the ones
the default base, heading and monospace fonts use:

- InterVariable.woff2: Inter (https://github.com/rsms/inter), SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, Inter-LICENSE.txt
- JetBrainsMono-Regular.woff2, JetBrainsMono-Bold.woff2: JetBrains Mono
  (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono), SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  JetBrainsMono-LICENSE.txt

Served at /fonts/ as Rails serves them. The gem's other fonts (a site set to
one of them, the admin's font previews, which name them all) are served from
the discourse-fonts-0.0.19 gem in DISCOURSE_SRC's bundle when it is set, and
are missing otherwise.
